@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts` is the runtime factory for `order-triage`. It loads the canonical instruction from `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` through its `loadCanonicalInstruction` parameter. The factory returns a classification-only agent and sets `canApproveRefunds` to `false`.
